 begin="00:15.290" end="00:17.180"><span begin="00:15.290" end="00:15.650">After </span><span begin="00:15.650" end="00:16.520">spending </span><span begin="00:16.520" end="00:17.180">nights</span><span begin="00:17.180" end="00:17.180">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.180" end="00:19.250"><span begin="00:17.180" end="00:17.780">Thinkin' </span><span begin="00:17.780" end="00:18.110">how </span><span begin="00:18.110" end="00:18.290">you </span><span begin="00:18.290" end="00:18.560">did </span><span begin="00:18.560" end="00:18.710">me </span><span begin="00:18.710" end="00:19.250">wrong</span><span begin="00:19.250" end="00:19.250">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.250" end="00:21.020"><span begin="00:19.250" end="00:19.520">I </span><span begin="00:19.520" end="00:19.790">grew </span><span begin="00:19.790" end="00:20.690">strong</span><span begin="00:20.690" end="00:21.020">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.020" end="00:23.060"><span begin="00:21.020" end="00:21.170">And </span><span begin="00:21.170" end="00:21.350">I </span><span begin="00:21.350" end="00:21.710">learn </span><span begin="00:21.710" end="00:22.070">how </span><span begin="00:22.070" end="00:22.220">to </span><span begin="00:22.220" end="00:22.460">get </span><span begin="00:22.460" end="00:23.060">along</span><span begin="00:23.060" end="00:23.060">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.060" end="00:27.020"><span begin="00:23.060" end="00:23.360">now </span><span begin="00:23.360" end="00:23.810">you're </span><span begin="00:23.810" end="00:24.740">back </span><span begin="00:24.740" end="00:25.430">from </span><span begin="00:25.430" end="00:25.670">outer </span><span begin="00:25.670" end="00:26.690">space</span><span begin="00:26.690" end="00:27.020">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.020" end="00:31.190"><span begin="00:27.020" end="00:27.560">And </span><span begin="00:27.560" end="00:27.770">I </span><span begin="00:27.770" end="00:28.190">find </span><span begin="00:28.190" end="00:28.520">you </span><span begin="00:28.520" end="00:28.970">here </span><span begin="00:28.970" end="00:29.210">with </span><span begin="00:29.210" end="00:29.480">that </span><span begin="00:29.480" end="00:29.810">sad </span><span begin="00:29.810" end="00:30.140">look </span><span begin="00:30.140" end="00:30.500">upon </span><span begin="00:30.500" end="00:30.710">your </span><span begin="00:30.710" end="00:31.160">face</span><span begin="00:31.160" end="00:31.190">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.190" end="00:33.530"><span begin="00:31.190" end="00:31.310">I </span><span begin="00:31.310" end="00:31.580">should </span><span begin="00:31.580" end="00:31.670">have </span><span begin="00:31.670" end="00:32.090">changed </span><span begin="00:32.090" end="00:32.270">that </span><span begin="00:32.270" end="00:32.630">stupid </span><span begin="00:32.630" end="00:33.290">lock</span><span begin="00:33.290" end="00:33.530">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.530" end="00:35.300"><span begin="00:33.530" end="00:33.830">or </span><span begin="00:33.830" end="00:34.160">make </span><span begin="00:34.160" end="00:34.250">you </span><span begin="00:34.250" end="00:34.550">leave </span><span begin="00:34.550" end="00:34.700">your </span><span begin="00:34.700" end="00:35.270">key</span><span begin="00:35.270" end="00:35.300">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.300" end="00:39.290"><span begin="00:35.300" end="00:35.510">but </span><span begin="00:35.510" end="00:35.750">I'don't </span><span begin="00:35.750" end="00:36.350">known </span><span begin="00:36.350" end="00:36.560">for </span><span begin="00:36.560" end="00:36.680">just </span><span begin="00:36.680" end="00:36.710">a </span><span begin="00:36.710" end="00:37.370">second </span><span begin="00:37.370" end="00:37.640">you'd </span><span begin="00:37.640" end="00:37.880">be </span><span begin="00:37.880" end="00:38.180">back </span><span begin="00:38.180" end="00:38.300">to </span><span begin="00:38.300" end="00:38.690">bother </span><span begin="00:38.690" end="00:39.110">me</span><span begin="00:39.110" end="00:39.290">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.290" end="00:42.860"><span begin="00:39.290" end="00:39.680">Go </span><span begin="00:39.680" end="00:39.920">on </span><span begin="00:39.920" end="00:40.730">now</span><span begin="00:40.730" end="00:40.970">, </span><span begin="00:40.970" end="00:41.510">walk </span><span begin="00:41.510" end="00:41.750">out </span><span begin="00:41.750" end="00:41.810">the </span><span begin="00:41.810" end="00:42.830">door</span><span begin="00:42.830" end="00:42.860">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.860" end="00:45.020"><span begin="00:42.860" end="00:43.130">Just </span><span begin="00:43.130" end="00:43.640">turn </span><span begin="00:43.640" end="00:44.300">around </span><span begin="00:44.300" end="00:45.020">now</span><span begin="00:45.020" end="00:45.020">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.020" end="00:48.080"><span begin="00:45.020" end="00:45.050">’</span><span begin="00:45.050" end="00:45.170">cause </span><span begin="00:45.170" end="00:45.560">you're </span><span begin="00:45.560" end="00:45.920">not </span><span begin="00:45.920" end="00:46.520">welcome </span><span begin="00:46.520" end="00:47.840">anymore</span><span begin="00:47.840" end="00:48.080">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.080" end="00:51.440"><span begin="00:48.080" end="00:48.350">you </span><span begin="00:48.350" end="00:48.590">are </span><span begin="00:48.590" end="00:48.920">the </span><span begin="00:48.920" end="00:49.250">one </span><span begin="00:49.250" end="00:49.400">who </span><span begin="00:49.400" end="00:49.730">tried </span><span begin="00:49.730" end="00:49.820">to </span><span begin="00:49.820" end="00:50.090">hurt </span><span begin="00:50.090" end="00:50.480">me </span><span begin="00:50.480" end="00:50.720">with </span><span begin="00:50.720" end="00:51.410">goodbye</span><span begin="00:51.410" end="00:51.440">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.440" end="00:52.820"><span begin="00:51.440" end="00:51.650">Did </span><span begin="00:51.650" end="00:51.830">I </span><span begin="00:51.830" end="00:52.820">crumble</span><span begin="00:52.820" end="00:52.820">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.820" end="00:55.160"><span begin="00:52.820" end="00:53.270">Did </span><span begin="00:53.270" end="00:53.480">you </span><span begin="00:53.480" end="00:53.660">think </span><span begin="00:53.660" end="00:53.870">I'd </span><span begin="00:53.870" end="00:54.320">lay </span><span begin="00:54.320" end="00:54.710">down </span><span begin="00:54.710" end="00:54.830">and </span><span begin="00:54.830" end="00:55.160">die</span><span begin="00:55.160" end="00:55.160">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.160" end="00:59.190"><span begin="00:55.160" end="00:55.190">Oh </span><span begin="00:55.190" end="00:55.580">no</span><span begin="00:55.580" end="00:55.580">, </span><span begin="00:55.580" end="00:56.090">not</span><span begin="00:56.090" end="00:56.090">.</span><span begin="00:56.090" end="00:56.840">I</span><span begin="00:56.840" end="00:57.140">. </span><span begin="00:57.140" end="00:57.530">I </span><span begin="00:57.530" end="00:57.770">will </span><span begin="00:57.770" end="00:58.910">survive</span><span begin="00:58.910" end="00:59.190">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.190" end="01:03.680"><span begin="00:59.190" end="00:59.310">As </span><span begin="00:59.310" end="00:59.750">long </span><span begin="00:59.750" end="01:00.110">as </span><span begin="01:00.110" end="01:00.290">I </span><span begin="01:00.290" end="01:00.530">know </span><span begin="01:00.530" end="01:00.800">how </span><span begin="01:00.800" end="01:00.890">to </span><span begin="01:00.890" end="01:01.760">love </span><span begin="01:01.760" end="01:02.030">I </span><span begin="01:02.030" end="01:02.270">know </span><span begin="01:02.270" end="01:02.510">I'll </span><span begin="01:02.510" end="01:02.780">stay </span><span begin="01:02.780" end="01:03.620">alive</span><span begin="01:03.620" end="01:03.680">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.680" end="01:05.480"><span begin="01:03.680" end="01:04.040">I</span><span begin="01:04.040" end="01:04.070">’</span><span begin="01:04.070" end="01:04.130">ve </span><span begin="01:04.130" end="01:04.340">got </span><span begin="01:04.340" end="01:04.400">all </span><span begin="01:04.400" end="01:04.550">my </span><span begin="01:04.550" end="01:04.850">life </span><span begin="01:04.850" end="01:04.970">to </span><span begin="01:04.970" end="01:05.480">live</span><span begin="01:05.480" end="01:05.480">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.480" end="01:10.040"><span begin="01:05.480" end="01:05.660">I</span><span begin="01:05.660" end="01:05.990">’</span><span begin="01:05.990" end="01:06.050">ve </span><span begin="01:06.050" end="01:06.170">got </span><span begin="01:06.170" end="01:06.350">all </span><span begin="01:06.350" end="01:06.560">my </span><span begin="01:06.560" end="01:06.860">love </span><span begin="01:06.860" end="01:06.980">to </span><span begin="01:06.980" end="01:07.400">give </span><span begin="01:07.400" end="01:07.970">and </span><span begin="01:07.970" end="01:08.690">I'll </span><span begin="01:08.690" end="01:09.800">survive</span><span begin="01:09.800" end="01:10.040">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.040" end="01:27.470"><span begin="01:10.040" end="01:11.030">I </span><span begin="01:11.030" end="01:11.540">will </span><span begin="01:11.540" end="01:14.450">survive</span><span begin="01:14.450" end="01:27.470">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.470" end="01:31.310"><span begin="01:27.470" end="01:27.890">It </span><span begin="01:27.890" end="01:28.310">took </span><span begin="01:28.310" end="01:28.640">all </span><span begin="01:28.640" end="01:28.880">my </span><span begin="01:28.880" end="01:29.600">strength </span><span begin="01:29.600" end="01:29.750">that </span><span begin="01:29.750" end="01:29.780">I </span><span begin="01:29.780" end="01:30.080">had </span><span begin="01:30.080" end="01:30.350">fall </span><span begin="01:30.350" end="01:31.130">apart</span><span begin="01:31.130" end="01:31.310">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.310" end="01:35.420"><span begin="01:31.310" end="01:31.970">trying </span><span begin="01:31.970" end="01:32.600">without </span><span begin="01:32.600" end="01:32.870">my </span><span begin="01:32.870" end="01:33.410">mind </span><span begin="01:33.410" end="01:33.560">to </span><span begin="01:33.560" end="01:33.860">mend </span><span begin="01:33.860" end="01:34.220">my </span><span begin="01:34.220" end="01:34.700">broken </span><span begin="01:34.700" end="01:35.330">heart</span><span begin="01:35.330" end="01:35.420">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.420" end="01:37.700"><span begin="01:35.420" end="01:35.690">I </span><span begin="01:35.690" end="01:36.050">spent </span><span begin="01:36.050" end="01:36.410">so </span><span begin="01:36.410" end="01:37.130">many </span><span begin="01:37.130" end="01:37.670">nights</span><span begin="01:37.670" end="01:37.700">，</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.700" end="01:41.420"><span begin="01:37.700" end="01:38.150">feeling </span><span begin="01:38.150" end="01:38.600">sorry </span><span begin="01:38.600" end="01:38.870">for </span><span begin="01:38.870" end="01:39.560">myself</span><span begin="01:39.560" end="01:39.590">, </span><span begin="01:39.590" end="01:39.950">how </span><span begin="01:39.950" end="01:40.100">I </span><span begin="01:40.100" end="01:41.120">cried</span><span begin="01:41.120" end="01:41.420">,</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.420" end="01:43.580"><span begin="01:41.420" end="01:41.690">But </span><span begin="01:41.690" end="01:41.960">now </span><span begin="01:4